---
title: Gin Fizz
servings: 1
tags: [cocktail, gin]
source: Classic cocktail, number 25 on Drinks International's 2026 bestselling classics; method written for this repository
---

In a #cocktail shaker{}(with ice), pour @gin{2%fl_oz}, @lemon juice{1%fl_oz} and @simple syrup{0.75%fl_oz}. Shake briskly for ~{15%seconds}, and strain into a #highball glass{} without ice. Top with @club soda{2%fl_oz} and serve at once.

> Add an egg white and dry-shake first for a Silver Fizz.
